Note on licensing
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The original repository declared its licence inconsistently: package.json
declared "Apache-2.0" while readme.md stated the MIT License and linked to a
LICENSE file that was never committed in any branch or commit of the project's
history.

The original author could not be reached to clarify. This repository therefore
follows Apache-2.0 — the declaration carried in package.json across every
commit, and the stricter of the two, so that the original author's terms are
honoured under either reading. No relicensing has taken place, and the original
author's copyright is retained above.
